          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Live webinars</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span style=\"color: #323232;\"><span style=\"color: #af6d04;\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">Tuesday, November 17</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Evidence related to turn &amp; positioning systems</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Jan Powers, PhD, RN, CCNS, CCRN, NE-BC, EBP-C, FCNS, FCCM, FAAN&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/training-and-education/medical-and-surgical-equipment--/sage/focusrn/upcoming-events.html\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><u>See details</u></span></span></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #85458a;\">Thursday, November 19</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Beyond the surface: Where clinical care meets quality reporting</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Kathleen Vollman MSN, RN, CCNS, FCCM, FCNS, FAAN and Tanya Martel DNP, FNP-BC, CWOCN&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/training-and-education/medical-and-surgical-equipment--/sage/focusrn/upcoming-events.html\" target=\"_self\" title=\"See more details and links to register.\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><u>See details</u></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 20 2026 19:26:36 GMT+0000",
